cture is correct otherwise.\n          variant: body\n        - component: Divider\n          id: divider_2\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol1_title\n          text: \"Solution 1: Formula-Based Approach\"\n          variant: h2\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol1_expl\n          text: Convert the text lookup value to a number within the formula. This is non-destructive to your data.\n          variant: body\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol1_steps_title\n          text: Steps\n          variant: h4\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol1_step_1\n          text: \"1. Identify the cell with the text-formatted lookup value (e.g., A2).\"\n          variant: body\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol1_step_2\n          text: 2. Modify the VLOOKUP formula to convert this value to a number.\n          variant: body\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol1_example_title\n          text: Example Formulas\n          variant: h4\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol1_example_1\n          text: \"Using Double Unary: =VLOOKUP(--A2, B:C, 2, FALSE)\"\n          variant: body\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol1_example_2\n          text: \"Using VALUE Function: =VLOOKUP(VALUE(A2), B:C, 2, FALSE)\"\n          variant: body\n        - component: Divider\n          id: divider_3\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol2_title\n          text: \"Solution 2: Formatting-Based Approach\"\n          variant: h2\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol2_expl\n          text: Permanently convert the source column data from text to numbers.\n          variant: body\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol2_steps_title\n          text: Steps\n          variant: h4\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol2_step_1\n          text: 1. Select the source column containing numbers stored as text.\n          variant: body\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol2_step_2\n          text: 2. Click the yellow 'Error Checking' icon that appears.\n          variant: body\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol2_step_3\n          text: 3. Select 'Convert to Number'.\n          variant: body\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol2_alt_title\n          text: Alternative Methods\n          variant: h4\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol2_alt_1\n          text: \"• Text to Columns: Data tab > Text to Columns > Finish.\"\n          variant: body\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol2_alt_2\n          text: \"• Paste Special (Multiply): Copy '1', select range, Paste Special > Multiply.\"\n          variant: body\n        - component: Text\n          id: sol2_alt_3\n          text: \"• Paste Special (Add): Copy '0', select range, Paste Special > Add.\"\n          variant: body\n        - component: Divider\n          id: divider_4\n        - component: Text\n          id: comparison_title\n          text: Comparison\n          variant: h3\n        - component: Row\n          id: table_head\n          children[4]: th_1,th_2,th_3,th_4\n        - component: Text\n          id: th_1\n          text: Type\n          variant: h5\n          weight: 1\n        - component: Text\n          id: th_2\n          text: Pros\n          variant: h5\n          weight: 1.5\n        - component: Text\n          id: th_3\n          text: Cons\n          variant: h5\n          weight: 1.5\n        - component: Text\n          id: th_4\n          text: Best Use\n          variant: h5\n          weight: 1.5\n        - component: Row\n          id: table_row_1\n          children[4]: tr1_1,tr1_2,tr1_3,tr1_4\n        - component: Text\n          id: tr1_1\n          text: Formula\n          variant: body\n          weight: 1\n        - component: Text\n          id: tr1_2\n          text: Non-destructive\n          variant: caption\n          weight: 1.5\n        - component: Text\n          id: tr1_3\n          text: Modifies formulas\n          variant: caption\n          weight: 1.5\n        - component: Text\n          id: tr1_4\n          text: Read-only source\n          variant: caption\n          weight: 1.5\n        - component: Row\n          id: table_row_2\n          children[4]: tr2_1,tr2_2,tr2_3,tr2_4\n        - component: Text\n          id: tr2_1\n          text: Format\n          variant: body\n          weight: 1\n        - component: Text\n          id: tr2_2\n          text: Permanent fix\n          variant: caption\n          weight: 1.5\n        - component: Text\n          id: tr2_3\n          text: Alters data\n          variant: caption\n          weight: 1.5\n        - component: Text\n          id: tr2_4\n          text: Clean data needed\n          variant: caption\n          weight: 1.5\n        - component: Divider\n          id: divider_5\n        - component: Text\n          id: actions_title\n          text: Quick Actions\n          variant: h3\n        - component: Row\n          id: actions_row\n          justify: start\n          children[2]: btn_help,btn_convert\n        - child: btn_help_text\n          component: Button\n          id: btn_help\n          action:\n            functionCall:\n              call: openUrl\n              args:\n                url: \"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/vlookup-function-0398606e-09a8-4229-9e63-c7e6c40a5a67\"\n        - component: Text\n          id: btn_help_text\n          text: VLOOKUP Help\n        - child: btn_convert_text\n          component: Button\n          id: btn_convert\n          action:\n            functionCall:\n              call: openUrl\n              args:\n                url: \"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/convert-numbers-stored-as-text-to-numbers-40a1b802-5509-480f-a0c0-6296b63a9404\"\n        - component: Text\n          id: btn_convert_text\n          text: Convert Data Help","validation":{"json_parse_ok":true,"schema_valid_strict":true,"schema_valid_lenient":true,"toon_roundtrip_ok":true,"errors":[],"r