     text: Repeat\n          variant: caption\n        - align: center\n          component: Row\n          id: volumeRow\n          children[3]: volumeIcon,volumeSlider,volumeText\n        - component: Icon\n          id: volumeIcon\n          name: volumeUp\n        - component: Slider\n          id: volumeSlider\n          label: Volume\n          max: 100\n          min: 0\n          value: 70\n          weight: 1\n        - component: Text\n          id: volumeText\n          text: 70%","validation":{"json_parse_ok":true,"schema_valid_strict":true,"schema_valid_lenient":true,"toon_roundtrip_ok":true,"errors":[],"repair_attempts":0,"repair_needed":false},"metrics":{"content_coverage":0.9354838709677419,"dup_rate":0.20161290322580644,"lint_score":1.0,"output_tokens_toon":272,"output_tokens_json":256,"component_count":25.0,"unique_component_types":8.0,"max_tree_depth":5.0,"avg_tree_depth":1.76,"container_to_text_ratio":1.1666666666666667,"information_chunking_score":0.711864406779661,"ui_modularity_score":0.12,"ui_decomposition_score":0.6445951035781543,"actionable_elements":0.0,"action_coverage":1.0,"url_as_text_rate":0.0,"table_pattern_detected":0.0,"table_cell_coverage":0.0,"section_heading_coverage":0.0,"markdown_leakage_rate":0.0,"missing_ids":0.0,"missing_ids_rate":0.0,"dangling_components":0.0,"dangling_components_rate":0.0,"intent_require_table":0.0,"intent_require_actions":0.0,"intent_require_sections":1.0,"intent_table_ok":0.0,"intent_actions_ok":0.0,"intent_sections_ok":0.0,"intent_expectation_pass":0.0,"intent_score":0.0},"gen":{"provider":"gemini","model":"gemini-3-pro-preview","prompt_version":"genui_gen_v1","latency_ms":45957.738637924194,"input_tokens":14108,"output_tokens":1421,"cost_usd":null,"error":null},"created_at":"2026-02-07T17:14:42.289305Z"}
{"ui_id":"u_000802_01","response_id":"r_000802_01","query_id":"q_000802","intent":"media playback","tags":["video playback","streaming ui","ux design"],"intent_bucket":"media_playback","genui_json":[{"version":"v0.9","createSurface":{"surfaceId":"surface_q_000802","catalogId":"https://genui.local/specification/v0_9/standard_catalog.json"}},{"version":"v0.9","updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"surface_q_000802","components":[{"id":"root","component":"Column","children":["text_1"]},{"id":"text_1","component":"Text","text":"Assumptions:\n- Standard video playback controls (play/pause, progress bar, volume, fullscreen toggle) are present in the control bar.\n- The 'Next Episode' button appears as an overlay, typically towards the end of the video or when paused.\n- The 'Skip Intro' button is a temporary, contextual overlay that appears at the specified timestamp.\n\nVideo Player Dashboard Design:\n\nSummary:\nThe dashboard provides a clean, intuitive interface for streaming content, focusing on the video playback while offering essential controls and contextual overlays for an enhanced user experience.\n\nDashboard Layout Description:\n\n1.  Main Video Area:\n    *   Occupies the majority of the screen, displaying the video 'Nature Documentary: The Deep Sea'.\n    *   Current resolution: 1080p (indicated subtly, perhaps in settings or a small overlay on hover).\n    *   Subtitles: Enabled (English), displayed at the bottom of the video frame.\n\n2.  Control Bar (Bottom of the player, appears on hover/interaction):\n    *   Playback Controls (Left):\n        *   Play/Pause button\n        *   Rewind/Fast Forward buttons (e.g., 10 seconds)\n    *   Progress Bar (Center):\n        *   Displays current time, total duration, and allows scrubbing through the video.\n        *   Current Position: e.g., 02:30 / 45:00\n    *   Volume Control (Right-Center):\n        *   Volume slider and mute toggle.\n    *   Information & Settings (Right):\n        *   Subtitles/CC icon (indicating English is active).\n        *   Settings Gear icon: Opens a menu for quality selection (e.g., 1080p, 720p, Auto), audio tracks, and other player preferences.\n        *   Fullscreen Toggle button.\n\n3.  Overlay Elements:\n    *   Skip Intro Button:\n        *   Appearance: A rectangular button overlay, e.g., \"Skip Intro\" or \"Skip (0:15)\"\n        *   Placement: Typically appears centrally or bottom-right of the video frame.\n        *   Context: Appears at the 02:15 mark of the video, remaining visible for a few seconds before fading out if not clicked.\n    *   Next Episode Overlay Button:\n        *   Appearance: A prominent button, e.g., \"Next Episode: Journey to the Abyss\"\n        *   Placement: Can appear centrally, or in the bottom-right corner of the video frame.\n        *   Context: Typically appears in the last 15-30 seconds of the current video, or when the video is paused.\n\nIcons:\n- Play: https://example.com/icons/play.svg\n- Pause: https://example.com/icons/pause.svg\n- Settings Gear: https://example.com/icons/settings.svg\n- Subtitles/CC: https://example.com/icons/subtitles.svg\n- Fullscreen: https://example.com/icons/fullscreen.svg\n- Volume: https://example.com/icons/volume.svg\n- Skip Intro: https://example.com/icons/skip-forward.svg (often represented by a skip-forward icon)\n- Next Episode: https://example.com/icons/next-episode.svg (often represented by a next track icon)\n\nImages:\n- Video Player Dashboard Example: https://example.com/ui-assets/video-player-dashboard-mockup.jpg","variant":"body"}]}}],"assets":[],"toon":"[2]:\n  - version: v0.9\n    createSurface:\n      catalogId: \"https://genui.local/specification/v0_9/standard_catalog.json\"\n      surfaceId: surface_q_000802\n  - version: v0.9\n    updateComponents:\n      surfaceId: surface_q_000802\n      components[2]:\n        - component: Column\n          id: root\n          children[1]: text_1\n        - component: Text\n          id: text_1\n          text: \"Assumptions:\\n- Standard video playback controls (play/pause, progress bar, volume, fullscreen toggle) are present in the control bar.\\n- The 'Next Episode' button appears as an overlay, typically towards the end of the video or when paused.\\n- The 'Skip Intro' button is a temporary, contextual overlay that appears at the specified timestamp.\\n\\nVideo Player Dashboard Design:\\n\\nSummary:\\nThe dashboard provides a clean, intuitive interface for streaming content, focusing on the video playback while offering essential controls and contextual overlays for an enhanced user experience.\\n\\nDashboard Layout Description:\\n\\n1.  Main Video Area:\\n    *   Occupies the majority of the screen, displaying the video 'Nature Documentary: The Deep Sea'.\\n    *   Current resolution: 1080p (indicated subtly, perhaps in settings or a small overlay on hover).\\n    *   Subtitles: Enabled (English), displayed at the bottom of the video frame.\\n\\n2.  Control Bar (Bottom of the player, appears on hover/interaction):\\n    *   Playback Controls (Left):\\n        *   Play/Pause button\\n        *   Rewind/Fast Forward buttons (e.g., 10 seconds)\\n    *   Progress Bar (Center):\\n        *   Displays current time, total duration, and allows scrubbing through the video.\\n        *   Current Position: e.g., 02:30 / 45:00\\n    *   Volume Control (Right-Center):\\n        *   Volume slider and mute toggle.\\n    *   Information & Settings (Right):\\n        *   Subtitles/CC icon (indicating English is active).\\n        *   Settings Gear icon: Opens a menu for quality selection (e.g., 1080p, 720p, Auto), audio tracks, and other player preferences.\\n        *   Fullscreen Toggle button.\\n\\n3.  Overlay Elements:\\n    *   Skip Intro Button:\\n        *   Appearance: A rectangular button overlay, e.g., \\\"Skip Intro\\\" or \\\"Skip (0:15)\\\"\\n        *   Placement: Typically appears centrally or bottom-right of the video frame.\\n        *   Context: Appears at the 02:15 mark of the video, remaining visible for a few seconds before fading out if not clicked.\\n    *   Next Episode Overlay Button:\\n        *   Appearance: A prominent button, e.g., \\\"Next Episode: Journey to the Abyss\\\"\\n        *   Placement: Can appear centrally, or in the bottom-right corner of the video frame.\\n        *   Context: Typically appears in the last 15-30 seconds of the current video, or when the video is paused.\\n\\nIcons:\\n- Play: https://example.com/icons/play.svg\\n- Pause: https://example.com/icons/pause.svg\\n- Settings Gear: https://example.com/icons/settings.svg\\n- Subtitles/CC: https://example.com/icons/subtitles.svg\\n- Fullscreen: https://example.com/icons/fullscreen.svg\\n- Volume: https://example.com/icons/volume.svg\\n- Skip Intro: https://example.com/icons/skip-forward.svg (often represented by a skip-forward icon)\\n- Next Episode: https://example.com/icons/next-episode.svg (often represented by a next track icon)\\n\\nImages:\\n- Video Player Dashboard Example: https://example.com/ui-assets/video-player-dashboard-mockup.jpg\"\n          variant: body","validation":{"json_parse_ok":true,"schema_valid_strict":true,"schema_valid_lenient":true,"toon_roundtrip_ok":true,"errors":["fallback_generated"],"repair_attempts":1,"repair_needed":true},"metrics":{"content_coverage":1.0,"dup_rate":0.05128205128205128,"lint_score":1.0,"output_tokens_toon":387,"output_tokens_json":382,"component_count":2.0,"unique_component_types":2.0,"max_tree_depth":2.0,"avg_tree_depth":1.5,"container_to_text_ratio":1.0,"information_chunking_score":0.0,"ui_modularity_score":0.0,"ui_decomposition_score":0.2833333333333333,"actionable_elements":0.0,"action_coverage":1.0,"url_as_text_rate":1.0,"table_pattern_detected":0.0,"table_cell_coverage":0.0,"section_heading_coverage":0.0,"markdown_leakage_rate":0.660377358490566,"missing_ids":0.0,"missing_ids_rate":0.0,"dangling_components":0.0,"dangling_components_rate":0.0,"intent_require_table":0.0,"intent_require_actions":0.0,"i